flowchart TB
    User[User] --> CLI[CLI / Menus]

    CLI --> SessionService[Session Service]
    CLI --> TrainingService[Training Service]
    CLI --> ReportService[Report Service]
    CLI --> SettingsService[Settings Service]

    Bootstrap[Bootstrap] --> AppContext[App Context: paths, settings, environment]
    AppContext --> SessionService
    AppContext --> TrainingService
    AppContext --> ReportService
    AppContext --> SettingsService

    SessionService --> Wizard[Session Wizard]
    Wizard --> SessionConfig[Session Configuration]
    SessionConfig --> Runtime[Session Runtime]
    Runtime --> Workspace[(Session Workspace)]

    Workspace --> KB[(Knowledge Base)]
    Workspace --> Logs[(Logs and Outputs)]
    Workspace --> Evidence[(Evidence and Reports)]

    Runtime --> Loop[Agent Loop]

    KB --> StateBuilder[State Builder]
    StateBuilder --> State[Compact State]

    State --> Policy[Decision Policy]
    Policy --> Scripted[Scripted]
    Policy --> Rules[Rules]
    Policy --> Model[Model-based]
    Model --> TrainedModel[(Trained Model)]

    Scripted --> Action[action_id]
    Rules --> Action
    Model --> Action

    Action --> Catalog[Action Catalog]
    Catalog --> CmdBuilder[Command Builder]
    KB --> CmdBuilder
    SessionConfig --> CmdBuilder

    CmdBuilder --> Command[Resolved Command]
    Command --> Executor[Command Executor]
    Executor --> Tools[Kali / Metasploit Tools]
    Tools --> Output[Command Output]

    Output --> Parser[Parser / Event Builder]
    Parser --> Events[Normalized Events]
    Events --> KBUpdater[KB Updater]
    KBUpdater --> KB

    State --> Logger[Session Logger]
    Action --> Logger
    Command --> Logger
    Output --> Logger
    Events --> Logger
    Logger --> Logs
    Logger --> DatasetSamples[(state-action samples)]

    TrainingService --> DatasetBuilder[Dataset Builder]
    Logs --> DatasetBuilder
    DatasetSamples --> DatasetBuilder
    DatasetBuilder --> Dataset[(Dataset JSONL)]
    Dataset --> Trainer[Training / Evaluation]
    Trainer --> TrainedModel
    Trainer --> Metrics[(Metrics)]

    ReportService --> ReportGenerator[Report Generator]
    KB --> ReportGenerator
    Logs --> ReportGenerator
    Evidence --> ReportGenerator
    Metrics --> ReportGenerator
    ReportGenerator --> FinalReport[Markdown / PDF Report]

    SettingsService --> Config[(Configuration)]
    Config --> AppContext